CONTEXT Catalogue IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT Catalogue
{+ A context with a rule that the preprocessor leaves out unless the variable `Strict` is set.
It serves the case `alias_with_variables.adl`, which sets that variable in its inclusion statement. +}

RELATION price[Product*Amount] [UNI]

--#IF Strict
RULE priced : I[Product] |- price;price~
MEANING "Every product has a price."
--#ENDIF

ENDCONTEXT
